+**Formulas:**
 The contribution of a single Gaussian widget to the output color/intensity is calculated as [S1]:
-
 $$
 I(x; \mu, \Sigma) = \frac{1}{\sqrt{2\pi}^3 \sqrt{|\Sigma|}} \exp \left( -\frac{1}{2} (x - \mu)^T \Sigma^{-1} (x - \mu) \right)
 $$
